## To native parseInt (s: Text) -> Int

## A Situation has:
    A minute: Int.
    A site: Int.
    A price: Int.
    A carbon: Int.
    An event: Int.
    A target: Int.
    An urgent: Int.
    A batch: Int.
    A backlog: Int.
    A left: Int.
    A room: Int.
    An otherPrice: Int.
    An otherInEvent: Int.
    An ownRoom: Int.

## To minOf (a: Int, b: Int) -> Int:
    If a is less than b:
        Return a.
    Return b.

## To maxOf (a: Int, b: Int) -> Int:
    If a is greater than b:
        Return a.
    Return b.

